{"4849560":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Capy Farm","steam_appid":4849560,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4873360],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Plants<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your farms space and grow plants, then grow even better plants to earn gold and become the best farm.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/4cee5fd01588583b4e0ad88a8292f4ea.poster.avif?t=1793642765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/4cee5fd01588583b4e0ad88a8292f4ea.webm?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/4cee5fd01588583b4e0ad88a8292f4ea.mp4?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy Upgrades<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can spend gold to buy upgrades at the shop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/31cb91673a0d2ad428b74346129cc411.poster.avif?t=1793642765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/31cb91673a0d2ad428b74346129cc411.webm?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/31cb91673a0d2ad428b74346129cc411.mp4?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automate<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your capybara friends to help you with the farm. They can harvest, water, seed and defend your farm from crows.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/e6098c66ed53436ae71631864a408c51.poster.avif?t=1793642765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/e6098c66ed53436ae71631864a408c51.webm?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/e6098c66ed53436ae71631864a408c51.mp4?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grand Harvest Competition<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to have the richest farm in the neighborhood and become the Grand Harvest Competition Champion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/ba47ca45ad1179669b4ee9e4c205b356.poster.avif?t=1793642765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/ba47ca45ad1179669b4ee9e4c205b356.webm?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/ba47ca45ad1179669b4ee9e4c205b356.mp4?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock All Seasons<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Run is a season of 90 days. Unlock Summer, Fall and Winter.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/d7ef75763508f38b11eda3e230e5d134.poster.avif?t=1793642765\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/d7ef75763508f38b11eda3e230e5d134.webm?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Plants<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your farms space and grow plants, then grow even better plants to earn gold and become the best farm.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/4cee5fd01588583b4e0ad88a8292f4ea.poster.avif?t=1793642765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/4cee5fd01588583b4e0ad88a8292f4ea.webm?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/4cee5fd01588583b4e0ad88a8292f4ea.mp4?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy Upgrades<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can spend gold to buy upgrades at the shop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/31cb91673a0d2ad428b74346129cc411.poster.avif?t=1793642765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/31cb91673a0d2ad428b74346129cc411.webm?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/31cb91673a0d2ad428b74346129cc411.mp4?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automate<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your capybara friends to help you with the farm. They can harvest, water, seed and defend your farm from crows.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/e6098c66ed53436ae71631864a408c51.poster.avif?t=1793642765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/e6098c66ed53436ae71631864a408c51.webm?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/e6098c66ed53436ae71631864a408c51.mp4?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grand Harvest Competition<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to have the richest farm in the neighborhood and become the Grand Harvest Competition Champion.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/ba47ca45ad1179669b4ee9e4c205b356.poster.avif?t=1793642765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/ba47ca45ad1179669b4ee9e4c205b356.webm?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/ba47ca45ad1179669b4ee9e4c205b356.mp4?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock All Seasons<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Run is a season of 90 days. Unlock Summer, Fall and Winter.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/d7ef75763508f38b11eda3e230e5d134.poster.avif?t=1793642765\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/extras\/d7ef75763508f38b11eda3e230e5d134.webm?t=1793642765\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A short incremental game where you build a farm run entirely by capybaras. Expand your fields, automate production, earn massive profits, and outperform rival farms to win the Grand Harvest Competition.","supported_languages":"English, German, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Swedish, Turkish, Ukrainian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/88bc9ad5dbe4c16900b175349757d3e373d3c10a\/header.jpg?t=1793642765","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/fad4e4e377de7f59f9ed5753cd5d2051c50c365b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793642765","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4849560\/fad4e4e377de7f59f9ed5753cd5d2051c50c365b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793642765","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i3 (4. Gen) or AMD FX-4300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrierte Intel HD Graphics 4000 or similar<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i5 (6. Gen) or AMD Ryzen 3<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics